<%- include('../partials/head', { title: 'About – Smart Learning Platform' }) %>
<%- include('../partials/topbar') %>

<div class="container py-5 mt-4">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-9">
      <div class="card-slw p-5 mb-4">
        <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-pill bg-light border mb-3">
          <span class="badge-slw badge-primary">Institutional EdTech</span>
          <span class="small text-muted">Architectural Overview</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-headline-lg mb-3">About Smart Learning Web App (SLWA)</h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-muted mb-4">
          Smart Learning is an institutional learning platform developed to bridge coursework, course materials, online assessment, and feedback across student, faculty, and administration boundaries.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-4">

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mb-3">Core Platform Principles</h2>
        <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light h-100">
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1 text-primary">Clarity Over Clutter</div>
              <p class="small text-muted mb-0">High-whitespace, distraction-free surfaces that prioritize academic focus over decorative excess.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light h-100">
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1 text-primary">Server-Enforced Role Security</div>
              <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Strict server-side validation ensuring users can only read and mutate authorized academic records.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light h-100">
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1 text-primary">Deterministic Assessment</div>
              <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Fair, timed examinations with automated objective grading and secure student ownership enforcement.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light h-100">
              <div class="fw-semibold mb-1 text-primary">Direct Academic Feedback</div>
              <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Constructive student reviews on specific course offerings to continuously improve instructional quality.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Technology Architecture</h2>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-4">
          SLWA is built on a clean three-tier architecture:
          <strong>Bootstrap 5.3</strong> and responsive HTML5 on the presentation layer,
          an <strong>Express.js</strong> RESTful backend handling business logic and session security, and a normalized <strong>MySQL</strong> relational database with primary keys, indexes, and referential integrity constraints.
        </p>

        <div class="d-flex gap-3">
          <a href="/courses" class="btn btn-primary-slw">Explore Course Catalog</a>
          <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-outline-slw">Sign In</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="py-4 border-top bg-white text-center text-muted small">
  <div class="container">
    <div>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Smart Learning Web App (SLWA). All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</footer>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
